<p>You call upon the mighty claw of a cold drake and rake a wave of freezing cold in front of you, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">136%, 147%, 156%, 163%, 170%</acronym> weapon damage as Ice damage in a cone of radius 3. Ice damage gives a chance of freezing the target.</p><p>Every level in Ice Claw additionally raises your Physical Save by 2.</p><p>Each point in cold drake talents also increases your cold resistance by 1%.</p><p></p><p>This talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.</p>